%
% Backward goal: list indexed access, out-of-range edge case — gmeow:listGet backing (#1009 §5).
% Index 5 exceeds the 3-element list (x y z): the rdf:rest walk runs off rdf:nil,
% so the goal returns empty bindings (no answer), status ok.
:- prefix(ex, 'https://example.org/profiles/goal-rdf-list-functions/').
:- prefix(rdf, 'http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#').
ex:get(L, 0, X) :- rdf:first(L, X).
ex:get(L, N, X) :- N > 0, rdf:rest(L, R), M is N - 1, ex:get(R, M, X).
?- ex:get(ex:l0, 5, X).
